@startuml
title PetLink V1.0 救助线索管理用例图
left to right direction

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "普通用户\nUSER" as User

rectangle "PetLink：救助线索管理" {
    usecase "发布救助线索\nUC-01" as C_PublishClue
    usecase "查看本人救助线索" as C_ViewOwnClue
    usecase "修改本人待审核线索" as C_EditClue
    usecase "撤回本人待审核线索" as C_WithdrawClue
    usecase "审核救助线索\nUC-02" as C_AuditClue
}

actor "救助人员\nRESCUER" as Rescuer
actor "系统管理员\nADMIN" as Admin

User -- C_PublishClue
User -- C_ViewOwnClue
User -- C_EditClue
User -- C_WithdrawClue

C_PublishClue -- Rescuer
C_ViewOwnClue -- Rescuer
C_EditClue -- Rescuer
C_WithdrawClue -- Rescuer

C_AuditClue -- Admin

note bottom of C_EditClue
仅 PENDING_REVIEW 状态且由本人发布的线索可修改或撤回。
end note

note bottom of C_AuditClue
审核结果为通过或驳回；驳回必须填写原因。
end note

@enduml
